# Agent and coding-harness workspaces
# The managed harness trees (.agents, .claude, .codex, .opencode, .pi and
# opencode.json) are TRACKED; `kendex refresh` renders them from
# kendex.toml. The links into .agents/skills are relative and the hook
# commands are repo-relative, so a clone works without running kendex.
# kendex.toml and kendex.settings.toml are tracked too: project-owned config
# (agent/skill wiring, review gates, Linear team) with no secrets — those
# live in .env.local.
#
# kendex: this machine's install ledger — the .agents trees and the
# links into them are committed, so a clone works without kendex.
/.kendex-lock.json
.vstack-lock.json
/.claude/settings.local.json
# Session-continuation state, never shared.
/.claude/RESUME.md
.kendex-refreshed
.vstack-refreshed

# Harness workspaces kendex does not render to — purely local editor state.
.aider*/
.continue/
.roo/
.windsurf/

# Local environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.local.example

# Runtime logs, scratch files, and caches.
#
# Dependency, virtualenv and cache dirs are ignored BARE, never with a trailing
# slash. A trailing-slash pattern matches a real directory but not a symlink
# pointing at one, so a store linked into a worktree stays untracked and
# `git add -A` can commit it (that is how drovr#644 landed a symlinked
# node_modules and broke `pnpm install` in CI). `.cache` is the live case here,
# since every worktree links it.
tmp/
.cache
logs/
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# Python helper/tooling artifacts
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.venv
venv

# Node/QML tooling artifacts
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.qmlcache/
qmlcache/
*.qmlc
*.jsc

# Quickshell/vshell live state belongs in ~/.config/vshell, not source snapshots
config/vshell/session.json
config/vshell/cache.json
config/vshell/theme.json
config/vshell/generated/
config/vshell/runtime/

# Editor and OS metadata
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local planning and research artifacts
docs/plans/
docs/research/
# Session handoff (single file, never committed) — see AGENTS.md § Conventions
docs/handoff/

# Machine-local companion to AGENTS.md: this workstation's expected symlinks and
# service state. Never committed — it describes one machine, and a tracked copy
# would rot on every other one.
/AGENTS.local.md

# Local git worktrees (vstack worktree skill)
/trees/
